<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/iterationCondition>(<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/wfResolveLoop>, <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/wfFixpointNotReached>, "default").
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/leftOperand>(<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/wfResolveThenBuild>, <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/wfResolveLoop>, "default").
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/rightOperand>(<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/wfResolveThenBuild>, <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/wfConstructModel>, "default").

